    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Course is a turn-based tactical game set in a brutal zombie apocalypse where teamwork is not just encouraged - it\u2019s essential. Whether you're coordinating as a squad of survivors trying to reach the final location, or playing as the infected determined to stop them, every match is a tense, strategic showdown between two sides with different strengths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a diverse roster of characters on both sides - each with their own playstyle, and role in combat. Survivors rely on firearms, consumable, and reusable equipment, while the infected unleash powerful inhuman abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636740/extras/76942f67e42c394484c6623f940a2376.avif?t=1752762620\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MODS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can experiment with different builds  by selecting one of two mod options for each equipment/ability. Mods become active as characters level up and  shape their strategy and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636740/extras/2522c9861e70ca1243742df92eca3589.avif?t=1752762620\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACTION POINTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn is powered by a randomly determined pool of shared action points. Players must cooperate, plan their moves carefully, prioritize actions, and adapt to the shifting conditions on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636740/extras/7359736f2a8716112828714fcb76b6cf.avif?t=1752762620\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOCATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every few rounds, a new location is drawn, lasting for a set duration and introducing effects that impact one or both sides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636740/extras/3426ac3f5fffaa7b9be3299abf1701eb.avif?t=1752762620\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Course is a turn-based tactical game set in a brutal zombie apocalypse where teamwork is not just encouraged - it\u2019s essential. Whether you're coordinating as a squad of survivors trying to reach the final location, or playing as the infected determined to stop them, every match is a tense, strategic showdown between two sides with different strengths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a diverse roster of characters on both sides - each with their own playstyle, and role in combat. Survivors rely on firearms, consumable, and reusable equipment, while the infected unleash powerful inhuman abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636740/extras/76942f67e42c394484c6623f940a2376.avif?t=1752762620\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MODS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can experiment with different builds  by selecting one of two mod options for each equipment/ability. Mods become active as characters level up and  shape their strategy and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636740/extras/2522c9861e70ca1243742df92eca3589.avif?t=1752762620\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACTION POINTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn is powered by a randomly determined pool of shared action points. Players must cooperate, plan their moves carefully, prioritize actions, and adapt to the shifting conditions on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636740/extras/7359736f2a8716112828714fcb76b6cf.avif?t=1752762620\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOCATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every few rounds, a new location is drawn, lasting for a set duration and introducing effects that impact one or both sides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636740/extras/3426ac3f5fffaa7b9be3299abf1701eb.avif?t=1752762620\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A turn-based tactical game that relies on teamwork. Form a squad and fight as survivors trying to escape - or as the infected making sure it\u2019s their last course. Choose from unique characters with distinct gear or abilities, and outplay the enemy through strategy and coordination.",
